#. Tag: title
#: introduction.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduccion"

#. Tag: title
#: introduction.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "What is &kappname;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: introduction.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kappname; is a fast and easy to use image viewer for KDE."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: introduction.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Gwenview features three main modes: Browse, View, and Full Screen. Browse "
"Mode lets you navigate through your computer showing thumbnails of your "
"images, View Mode lets you view images one at a time, and Full Screen lets "
"you make quick slideshows."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: introduction.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Image loading is handled by the Qt library, so &kappname; supports all image "
"formats your Qt installation supports. &kappname; correctly displays images "
"with an alpha channel (transparency) as well as animations."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: introduction.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; supports the displaying and editing of EXIF comments in JPEG "
"images. Lossless JPEG transforms such as rotations and mirroring are also "
"supported."
msgstr ""

